ch maib uses to process the payment and prevent fraud.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"Payment: you enter your card details only on the secure maib payment page; we never see or store them. From maib we receive the payment result, the masked card number (for example 4111 11** **** 1111) and the transaction details. When you start a payment, we send maib your name, e-mail, phone number, IP address and browser type, which maib uses to process the payment and prevent fraud."}],"$L30","$L31"]]}],"$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36"],false]}]]}],["$L37","$L38"],"$L39"]}]
